      "supports": [
        "Params4bit._quantize assigns its packed result to self.data.",
        "The unquantized Params4bit.to route calls _quantize before returning.",
        "Pinned PyTorch set_data requires compatible TensorImpl types.",
        "Pinned TensorImpl dense compatibility includes CPU and CUDA but excludes XLA."
      ],
      "limitations": [
        "The source explains the recorded assignment failure; it does not prove a correction.",
        "A target-device constructor or from_prequantized result cannot qualify CPU-to-XLA .to."
      ],
